    {
      "subId": "102202",
      "subQuestName": "Investigate the Fatui's research",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "10220201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "10220201": {
            "id": "10220201",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "There are so many talismans here! And some stacks of blank paper, too! Hmm, what are they for?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10220204"
            ]
          },
          "10220204": {
            "id": "10220204",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Paimon's seen this pattern before! But where...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10220205"
            ]
          },
          "10220205": {
            "id": "10220205",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Oh, Paimon knows! It looks just like the Sigil of Permission that Childe gave you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10220206"
            ]
          },
          "10220206": {
            "id": "10220206",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hmm, but how did a relic of the adepti end up in the hands of someone like Childe? Suspicious...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10220207"
            ]
          },
          "10220207": {
            "id": "10220207",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "It's not just a relic...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10220208"
            ]
          },
          "10220208": {
            "id": "10220208",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Oh, that's right. Cloud Retainer said that when the Lord of Geo created the Sigil of Permission, it wasn't to be used as some ol' relic...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10220209"
            ]
          },
          "10220209": {
            "id": "10220209",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Talismans like that were once used in the Archon War to channel divine powers.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10220210"
            ]
          },
          "10220210": {
            "id": "10220210",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Maybe the Fatui are copying the Sigil of Permission in hopes of achieving a similar effect?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10220211"
            ]
          },
          "10220211": {
            "id": "10220211",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Being able to channel divine power in battle... Whew, that sounds pretty dangerous."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "102203",
      "subQuestName": "Meet Zhongli at Dihua Marsh",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "10220301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "10220301": {
            "id": "10220301",
            "speakerId": 10232,
            "speakerName": "Zhongli",
            "text": "Right on time. I myself only arrived moments ago.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10220302"
            ]
          },
          "10220302": {
            "id": "10220302",
            "speakerId": 10232,
            "speakerName": "Zhongli",
            "text": "Did you enjoy your visit to the Jade Chamber?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10220303"
            ]
          },
          "10220303": {
            "id": "10220303",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "It was so biiig, and preetty, and expensive... Paimon's never seen such a fancy-schmancy place before!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10220304"
            ]
          },
          "10220304": {
            "id": "10220304",
            "speakerId": 10232,
            "speakerName": "Zhongli",
            "text": "Indeed. It's second to none in all of Liyue.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10220305"
            ]
          },
          "10220305": {
            "id": "10220305",
            "speakerId": 10232,
            "speakerName": "Zhongli",
            "text": "Then you met with Ningguang, I trust? What did you talk about with her?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10220306"
            ]
          },
          "10220306": {
            "id": "10220306",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "She's super rich and so generous. Paimon thinks she's very friendly!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10220307"
            ]
          },
          "10220307": {
            "id": "10220307",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Business people are always \"friendly\" when it suits their interests.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10220308"
            ]
          },
          "10220308": {
            "id": "10220308",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#Yeah, {M#his}{F#her} take on Ningguang is quite different from Paimon's. {M#He}{F#She} thinks that even the tactless Yuheng is more trustworthy than her.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10220309"
            ]
          },
          "10220309": {
            "id": "10220309",
            "speakerId": 10232,
            "speakerName": "Zhongli",
            "text": "Oh, so you also met with Keqing, then? What did she have to say?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10220310"
            ]
          },
          "10220310": {
            "id": "10220310",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "She said, \"The time of the adepti has long passed. If even the Liyue Qixing don't want to face that truth, then what future is there for Liyue?\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10220311"
            ]
          },
          "10220311": {
            "id": "10220311",
            "speakerId": 10232,
            "speakerName": "Zhongli",
            "text": "Haha, no respect for the divine.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10220312"
            ]
          },
          "10220312": {
            "id": "10220312",
            "speakerId": 10232,
            "speakerName": "Zhongli",
            "text": "Indeed, contrary to the ever-bold Keqing, Ningguang is more of a businesswoman at heart, though they are both members of the Qixing.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10220313"
            ]
          },
          "10220313": {
            "id": "10220313",
            "speakerId": 10232,
            "speakerName": "Zhongli",
            "text": "Although she's friendly, there's no way of clearly discerning her true intentions.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10220316"
            ]
          },
          "10220316": {
            "id": "10220316",
            "speakerId": 10232,
            "speakerName": "Zhongli",
            "text": "Yes, she has only relied on herself to rise to her current position. No ordinary person could ever achieve that.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10220317"
            ]
          },
          "10220317": {
            "id": "10220317",
            "speakerId": 10232,
            "speakerName": "Zhongli",
            "text": "It's said that she's the one behind the constant expansion of the Jade Chamber. It's the second most important thing to her. Even if she ever gave up the position of Tianquan, she would never give up the Jade Chamber.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10220318"
            ]
          },
          "10220318": {
            "id": "10220318",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "The Jade Chamber is only second? What's the most important thing to her then?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10220319"
            ]
          },
          "10220319": {
            "id": "10220319",
            "speakerId": 10232,
            "speakerName": "Zhongli",
            "text": "Why, Mora, of course."
          }
        }
      }
    },
