    {
      "subId": "102208",
      "subQuestName": "Ask around for news",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "10220801"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "10220801": {
            "id": "10220801",
            "speakerId": 10272,
            "speakerName": "Felix",
            "text": "Ah, you're the consultant to Wangsheng Funeral Parlor — Mr. Zhongli, I presume?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10220802"
            ]
          },
          "10220802": {
            "id": "10220802",
            "speakerId": 10272,
            "speakerName": "Felix",
            "text": "The Millelith are watching our every move now. These are desperate times, we mustn't act rashly.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10220803"
            ]
          },
          "10220803": {
            "id": "10220803",
            "speakerId": 10232,
            "speakerName": "Zhongli",
            "text": "Desperate times?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10220804"
            ]
          },
          "10220804": {
            "id": "10220804",
            "speakerId": 10272,
            "speakerName": "Felix",
            "text": "The adepti of Jueyun Karst are finally on the move.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10220805"
            ]
          },
          "10220805": {
            "id": "10220805",
            "speakerId": 10232,
            "speakerName": "Zhongli",
            "text": "Do they intend to exercise force?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10220806"
            ]
          },
          "10220806": {
            "id": "10220806",
            "speakerId": 10272,
            "speakerName": "Felix",
            "text": "Most likely. I've heard that some members of the Qixing have already gone to meet them... Well, I say \"meet,\" but it's more like they're attempting to stall the adepti outside the city.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10220807"
            ]
          },
          "10220807": {
            "id": "10220807",
            "speakerId": 10272,
            "speakerName": "Felix",
            "text": "However, both sides were quite obstinate, and hit an impasse.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10220808"
            ]
          },
          "10220808": {
            "id": "10220808",
            "speakerId": 10232,
            "speakerName": "Zhongli",
            "text": "...It seems inevitable, given the current situation.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10220809"
            ]
          },
          "10220809": {
            "id": "10220809",
            "speakerId": 10272,
            "speakerName": "Felix",
            "text": "The adepti do not acknowledge the Qixing, they only acknowledge the contracts of the Geo Archon. If the two sides come to blows, Liyue Harbor will be in no position to stop them.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10220810"
            ]
          },
          "10220810": {
            "id": "10220810",
            "speakerId": 10232,
            "speakerName": "Zhongli",
            "text": "Surely the Liyue Qixing are not the sort to give in so easily?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10220811"
            ]
          },
          "10220811": {
            "id": "10220811",
            "speakerId": 10272,
            "speakerName": "Felix",
            "text": "Hmph. Their bone-headedness is known throughout the lands. Yet it's because of that obstinacy that mortals and adepti are now on the verge of conflict.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10220812"
            ]
          },
          "10220812": {
            "id": "10220812",
            "speakerId": 10232,
            "speakerName": "Zhongli",
            "text": "And what now? How is it that the Fatui have come under fire?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10220813"
            ]
          },
          "10220813": {
            "id": "10220813",
            "speakerId": 10272,
            "speakerName": "Felix",
            "text": "Ugh... that's all Ningguang's doing...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10220814"
            ]
          },
          "10220814": {
            "id": "10220814",
            "speakerId": 10272,
            "speakerName": "Felix",
            "text": "She proclaimed that \"in these tumultuous times, the Millelith must rein in the actions of the Fatui.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10220815"
            ]
          },
          "10220815": {
            "id": "10220815",
            "speakerId": 10272,
            "speakerName": "Felix",
            "text": "Only now do they want to start keeping tabs on us? Huh! That's the Qixing for you!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10220816"
            ]
          },
          "10220816": {
            "id": "10220816",
            "speakerId": 10272,
            "speakerName": "Felix",
            "text": "Anyway, Mr. Zhongli, you're one of Childe's close associates. Please understand that your actions will reflect on us. Don't let anyone catch you off-guard.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10220817"
            ]
          },
          "10220817": {
            "id": "10220817",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "It looks like things are about to boil over in Liyue Harbor...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10220820"
            ]
          },
          "10220820": {
            "id": "10220820",
            "speakerId": 10232,
            "speakerName": "Zhongli",
            "text": "Do you intend to use your neutral identity as an intermediary between both sides? Or, will you use your sword to turn the balance?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10220821"
            ]
          },
          "10220821": {
            "id": "10220821",
            "speakerId": 10232,
            "speakerName": "Zhongli",
            "text": "Neither path is an easy one...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10220822"
            ]
          },
          "10220822": {
            "id": "10220822",
            "speakerId": 10272,
            "speakerName": "Felix",
            "text": "Oh, by the way, Mr. Zhongli. We've heard that the Wangsheng Funeral Parlor has also been caught up in all this. They're currently squaring off with the authorities at the gates.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10220823"
            ]
          },
          "10220823": {
            "id": "10220823",
            "speakerId": 10232,
            "speakerName": "Zhongli",
            "text": "Things are taking a turn for the worse...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10220824"
            ]
          },
          "10220824": {
            "id": "10220824",
            "speakerId": 10232,
            "speakerName": "Zhongli",
            "text": "I'm afraid I must leave now to handle things back at Wangsheng Funeral Parlor. I hope that Master Hu has been able to keep things under control for the moment.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10220825"
            ]
          },
          "10220825": {
            "id": "10220825",
            "speakerId": 10232,
            "speakerName": "Zhongli",
            "text": "#Consider your next course of action carefully, {NICKNAME}. If you're trying to prevent an explosion, it may be wisest to look for the fuse first.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10220827"
            ]
          },
          "10220827": {
            "id": "10220827",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Phew... Having connections with the Fatui seems to be quite the double-edged sword.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10220828"
            ]
          },
          "10220828": {
            "id": "10220828",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "So what did Zhongli mean by looking for the \"fuse\"?"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}